    "primaryRequest": "Create one clean Identity / Turnaround source-sheet candidate for Yui. Show neutral front, anatomical left, anatomical right, and back at identical scale on shared ground and proportion lines. Every view must be the same young-adult person with the same body, face, warm-dark asymmetric bob with one ear tuck, hooded travel clothing, construction, and wear. This is visual evidence for one logical Character Design Master Pack, not a separate Character Master and not a poster.",
